      "kind": "tools",
      "result": {
        "content": "Received: from outbound.cedar.example ([198.51.100.110]) by mx.aster.example with ESMTPS; Tue, 18 Aug 2026 09:10:00 +0900\nAuthentication-Results: mx.aster.example; spf=pass smtp.mailfrom=cedar.example; dkim=pass header.d=cedar.example; dmarc=pass header.from=cedar.example\nFrom: 取引窓口 <orders@cedar.example>\nTo: mori@aster.example\nReply-To: 取引窓口 <orders@cedar.example>\nReturn-Path: <bounce@cedar.example>\nSubject: 発注資料\n\nMIME本文の抜粋:\nContent-Type: application/zip\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"order-docs.zip\"\nGatewayがMIMEから抽出して保存した添付: {{fact:attachment}}",
        "information": [
